sequenceDiagram
    participant B as 浏览器
    participant GW as gateway
    participant P as 游戏模块
    participant AG as agent
    participant L as LiteTopic

    B->>GW: POST 动作
    GW->>P: 转发
    P->>AG: submit Agent
    P-->>GW: 202/201 受理
    GW-->>B: 短响应
    B->>GW: GET /stream
    GW->>GW: 挂 SseEmitter
    GW->>L: 订阅 irisa-frame-{playerId}-{topic}
    AG->>L: FrameSink.send
    L->>GW: 投递
    GW-->>B: SSE event
